<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-Feb 26.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
